# Ravenous Robots: "Whenever you cast an artifact spell, create a 1/1 colorless Robot artifact creature token" - your spells
# only and artifact spells only: Mox Jet (turn 1) makes a token, Bot2's Mox Sapphire (turn 2) and Bot1's Lightning Bolt
# (turn 3) do not. "{R}, {T}: Creature tokens you control gain haste until end of turn" fixes its set as it resolves
# (CR 611.2c): turn 3, a Mox Emerald cast first makes a token that gains haste and attacks, while the Ornithopter cast
# after the ability makes a token that does not, and the Ornithopter itself (an artifact creature, but not a token) has no haste
# either, nor has the Robots itself, a creature that is no token - those three have no Haste in the dump, beside the hasty token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Ravenous Robots
Mox Jet
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island x14

